{"page":410,"verses":[{"verse_key":"30:51","surah":30,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِنْ أَرْسَلْنَا رِيحًا فَرَأَوْهُ مُصْفَرًّا لَّظَلُّوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ يَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet they will continue in their disbelief, even if We send a [scorching] wind and they see their crops turn yellow.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِنْ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رِيحًۭا","en_gloss":"a wind","transliteration":"rīḥan","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَرَأَوْهُ","en_gloss":"and they see it","transliteration":"fara-awhu","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُصْفَرًّۭا","en_gloss":"turn yellow","transliteration":"muṣ'farran","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّظَلُّوا۟","en_gloss":"certainly they continue","transliteration":"laẓallū","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"after it","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"(in) disbelief","transliteration":"yakfurūna","verse_key":"30:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"30:51"}]},{"verse_key":"30:52","surah":30,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِنَّكَ لَا تُسْمِعُ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ وَلَا تُسْمِعُ ٱلصُّمَّ ٱلدُّعَآءَ إِذَا وَلَّوْا۟ مُدْبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You [Prophet] cannot make the dead hear and you cannot make the deaf hear your call when they turn their backs and leave;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"So indeed, you","transliteration":"fa-innaka","verse_key":"30:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(can) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"30:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تُسْمِعُ","en_gloss":"make the dead hear","transliteration":"tus'miʿu","verse_key":"30:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"make the dead hear","transliteration":